{"data": {"event": {"id": "3a49a0b1-d95c-426a-9038-ed978f2eac63", "picture": "https://services.medicalcongress.online/congress/medias/2026/JFR2026/1192/video/thumbs/poster.jpg", "sessionType": "S\u00e9ances de cours", "sessionTypeColor": "#6545fa", "voting": null, "title": "Lipofilling, chirurgie, radioth\u00e9rapie et traumatismes : quand la graisse devient un d\u00e9fi diagnostique en s\u00e9nologie", "start": "2026-10-10T17:00+02:00", "end": "2026-10-10T18:00+02:00", "objectives": ["<p data-end=\"496\" data-start=\"407\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Comprendre les&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"456\" data-start=\"422\">m\u00e9canismes physiopathologiques</strong>&nbsp;de la graisse mammaire modifi\u00e9e apr\u00e8s&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 1em; background-color: rgb(238, 238, 238);\">lipofilling (esth\u00e9tique ou reconstructeur),&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 1em; background-color: rgb(238, 238, 238);\">chirurgie mammaire,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 1em; background-color: rgb(238, 238, 238);\">radioth\u00e9rapie,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 1em; background-color: rgb(238, 238, 238);\">traumatisme.</span></p>", "<p data-end=\"747\" data-start=\"607\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Conna\u00eetre les&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"659\" data-start=\"621\">techniques de lipofilling mammaire</strong>, leurs modalit\u00e9s pratiques et leur \u00e9volution attendue, gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9clairage chirurgical.</p>", "<p data-end=\"747\" data-start=\"607\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Identifier les&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"863\" data-start=\"797\">aspects typiques et atypiques de la cytost\u00e9aton\u00e9crose mammaire</strong>&nbsp;en :</p>", "<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">mammographie, \u00e9chographie, IRM.</p>", "<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Distinguer les images de graisse modifi\u00e9e des&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"1234\" data-start=\"1191\">l\u00e9sions mammaires suspectes ou malignes</strong></p>", "<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Reconna\u00eetre les&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"971\" data-start=\"947\">pi\u00e8ges diagnostiques</strong>&nbsp;les plus fr\u00e9quents, notamment en l\u2019absence de cicatrice d'ant\u00e9riorit\u00e9 traumatique ou chirurgicale</p>", "<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Savoir proposer les examens compl\u00e9mentaires pour \u00e9viter les gestes invasifs inutiles</p>", "<ul>", "\t<li data-end=\"747\" data-start=\"605\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">", "\t<div class=\"relative basis-auto flex-col -mb-(--composer-overlap-px) [--composer-overlap-px:28px] grow flex\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">", "\t<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">", "\t<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-10\" data-turn=\"assistant\" data-turn-id=\"5f9837b5-fe0e-4575-b48a-cc63ad906f6b\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"-1\">&nbsp;</article>", "\t</div>", "\t</div>", "\t<div class=\"sticky bottom-0 group/thread-bottom-container relative isolate z-10 w-full basis-auto has-data-has-thread-error:pt-2 has-data-has-thread-error:[box-shadow:var(--sharp-edge-bottom-shadow)] md:border-transparent md:pt-0 dark:border-white/20 md:dark:border-transparent print:hidden content-fade single-line\" id=\"thread-bottom-container\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">", "\t<div class=\"text-base mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spac